# INVWINDR.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: a drop the
# server refuses.  Item 3 is installed in item 1, so at Office; Move on
# it in the split view's contents, to Box B2, is refused in its dialog as
# installed, and ESC and Y leave the dialog.  The same item dragged onto
# Box B2 is refused with the same text in a message box over the frame,
# after which the contents are as they were.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINDR.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/dragchk.py checks
# it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER DOWN DOWN ALT-C I
T 1
K ENTER
S INSTLD
K ALT-L B
S LOCS
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 UP ROW 1
K ALT-C M
T B2
K ENTER
S MVINST
K ESC Y
S MVBACK
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 1 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 2
M 208.1 UP ROW 2
S REFUSED
K ENTER
S REFBACK
K ALT-F X
